          "en": "(gentle tones)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "-: Now let's try to solve the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "with the help of containerization.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.3,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "The thing is, if you talk about containerization,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 9.51,
          "en": "what we have talked about is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 9.51,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "we have a hardware on top of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "We have a host OS, then we have a hypervisor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 13.44,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "which is your virtual machine software.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 16.995,
          "en": "And then on top of that you have a guest OS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 16.995,
          "end": 19.02,
          "en": "and on this guest OS, basically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 19.02,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "you have your application requirements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 24.51,
          "en": "Like, say you have web server, databases, your compilers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 26.61,
          "en": "everything installed on this OS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 26.61,
          "end": 28.89,
          "en": "And then when you want to give this to someone else,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 28.89,
          "end": 30.03,
          "en": "you don't give the software,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 30.03,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "you give the entire guest OS image, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "Now to solve this problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 37.35,
          "en": "because when you say the entire guest OS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 38.183,
          "en": "it's heavy right, to run it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 38.183,
          "end": 39.96,
          "en": "Now the additional problem with the guest OS is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 39.96,
          "end": 42.6,
          "en": "what if you have multiple apps to run?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 42.6,
          "end": 44.694,
          "en": "So you have to install multiple guest OS, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 44.694,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "So on the hypervisor you're not running one guest OS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 48.96,
          "en": "but multiple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 48.96,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "And don't you think there are multiple guest OS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 53.79,
          "en": "which will be very heavy, let's say five to six guest OS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 53.79,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "or five to six applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 57.09,
          "en": "Now to solve this problem, we can use containers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 57.09,
          "end": 59.13,
          "en": "Now, if you talk about the shipping industry, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 60.54,
          "en": "I'm not an expert in shipping industry,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 60.54,
          "end": 63.54,
          "en": "but let's say if you want to move some things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 63.54,
          "end": 66.78,
          "en": "from one location to other location through a sea route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 69,
          "en": "Now, of course you can just take this item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 69,
          "end": 71.31,
          "en": "pack it in a box and then send it to other place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "Again in the ship, when you want to carry it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 74.91,
          "en": "you want to ship it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 74.91,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "I know it's a very complex English here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 79.35,
          "en": "which is shipping the ships, but the point is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 79.35,
          "end": 81.18,
          "en": "when you want to again ship it on the ship,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 81.18,
          "end": 84.18,
          "en": "you have to box it again so that it'll waterproof so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 84.18,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "that you know, no water will get in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 88.23,
          "en": "and then you will ship it to the other port,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 88.23,
          "end": 90.84,
          "en": "the destination port and then from there on the trucks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 90.84,
          "end": 92.85,
          "en": "you will load it again and then you will ship it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 92.85,
          "end": 95.75999999999999,
          "en": "The easier way would be, what if you can use containers?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 95.75999999999999,
          "end": 97.68,
          "en": "Now you have seen this containers a lot, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 97.68,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "So in fact, in one of my first project in a company,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 101.91,
          "en": "the client was a shipping company,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 101.91,
          "end": 105.18,
          "en": "so I don't want to name it, so what they do is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 105.18,
          "end": 108.63,
          "en": "from the source location, when they want to pack things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 108.63,
          "end": 111,
          "en": "they directly put the things inside a container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 111,
          "end": 112.65,
          "en": "So let's say they have 10 boxes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 112.65,
          "end": 114.84,
          "en": "All these 10 boxes goes inside the container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 114.84,
          "end": 117.468,
          "en": "Now this exact container, the entire container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 117.468,
          "end": 121.73,
          "en": "goes on a truck, reaches to the source port,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 121.73,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "and then from this port they will load it to the ship",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 128.34,
          "en": "and then they will dock it to a ship and then from there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "the ship will carry the same container, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "There's no unboxing and boxing happening here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 134.79,
          "en": "The same container goes to the destination port,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 134.79,
          "end": 137.67000000000002,
          "en": "and then from there, the same container goes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 137.67000000000002,
          "end": 141.54,
          "en": "on to undock and then it'll go to the truck",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 141.54,
          "end": 143.106,
          "en": "and this truck goes to the destination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 143.106,
          "end": 145.95,
          "en": "Now in the entire process, the things are moving",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 145.95,
          "end": 147,
          "en": "inside a container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "That is much easier, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 149.61,
          "en": "Now that's where this concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 151.14,
          "en": "of containers came into picture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 151.14,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "Now can we do that in software?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "Now think about this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 155.57999999999998,
          "en": "What if in the virtualization itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 157.17000000000002,
          "en": "or maybe let's remove virtualization,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 159.32999999999998,
          "en": "you have your hardware, physical hardware,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 159.32999999999998,
          "end": 161.76,
          "en": "and then you have your host OS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 161.76,
          "end": 165.66,
          "en": "On top of it, you don't have to install any virtual machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 165.66,
          "end": 168.55700000000002,
          "en": "but let's say you use some containerization softwares.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 168.55700000000002,
          "end": 171.93,
          "en": "Now we have an option of like Docker, Podman,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 171.93,
          "end": 172.763,
          "en": "there are multiple options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 172.763,
          "end": 174.48,
          "en": "So what you do is you install this software,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 174.48,
          "end": 175.313,
          "en": "let's say Docker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 175.313,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "Docker is powerful enough to run the container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 180.69,
          "en": "not one container, but multiple containers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 180.69,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "So instead of running your software on the OS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 186.87,
          "en": "you are running your software inside the container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 186.87,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "Now from the developer's perspective,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 190.65,
          "en": "when you are building a project, you will not be building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 190.65,
          "end": 192.45,
          "en": "a project directly on your OS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 192.45,
          "end": 194.94,
          "en": "You will make sure that your app is running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 194.94,
          "end": 197.85,
          "en": "on the container as in software, maybe let's say Docker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 197.85,
          "end": 199.65,
          "en": "Now in this container, which you're getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 199.65,
          "end": 201.63,
          "en": "on your machine, you have everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 201.63,
          "end": 205.77,
          "en": "You have your compiler, web server, database connections",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 208.77,
          "en": "or database software, everything in this container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 208.77,
          "end": 210.69,
          "en": "Now, when you want to give this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 210.69,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "to your testing team, you will not give the project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 215.55,
          "en": "What you will give is the container itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 215.55,
          "end": 218.61,
          "en": "So this container goes from here, goes to your testing team",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 220.38,
          "en": "and then from there it goes to the production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 220.38,
          "end": 222.51,
          "en": "You're not giving the project, you're giving the containers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 222.51,
          "end": 226.65,
          "en": "And the beauty is, now since you are doing this on Docker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 226.65,
          "end": 230.43,
          "en": "the same container will go from your machine to testing team",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 230.43,
          "end": 233.31,
          "en": "or testers machine and even they will have a Docker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 233.31,
          "end": 234.39,
          "en": "of course they have to install Docker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 234.39,
          "end": 235.65,
          "en": "and then you can run it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 235.65,
          "end": 237.66,
          "en": "Now installing Docker is not a tedious process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 239.19,
          "en": "You just have to install one software",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 239.19,
          "end": 240.81,
          "en": "and then the exact container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 240.81,
          "end": 242.85,
          "en": "the way it is working in your machine will work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 242.85,
          "end": 244.41,
          "en": "on their machine, in the same way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 244.41,
          "end": 247.14,
          "en": "Its same goes for the production server and also cloud",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 247.14,
          "end": 249.39,
          "en": "because most of the cloud applications supports Docker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 249.39,
          "end": 250.35,
          "en": "or cloud services.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 250.35,
          "end": 253.14,
          "en": "So basically what I'm saying is, when you build a software,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 253.14,
          "end": 255.57,
          "en": "build it in the container, the same container goes on there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 255.57,
          "end": 257.73,
          "en": "and then from there and then it works everywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 257.73,
          "end": 258.78,
          "en": "Now what are the advantages?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 258.78,
          "end": 261,
          "en": "First of all, containers is the isolation part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 261,
          "end": 264.03,
          "en": "So if you run one application, one container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 264.03,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "it'll not interact with the other containers, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 268.29,
          "en": "So you have different containers running on the same OS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 268.29,
          "end": 270.75,
          "en": "Now the advantage is, you only have one OS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 270.75,
          "end": 272.7,
          "en": "So the load on your machine will be less.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 272.7,
          "end": 274.56,
          "en": "Additionally, when you talk about virtualization,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 274.56,
          "end": 275.73,
          "en": "you have OS there, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 275.73,
          "end": 277.8,
          "en": "Starting an OS takes time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 277.8,
          "end": 280.86,
          "en": "So let's say you are giving this OS open to image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 281.94,
          "en": "to your testing team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 281.94,
          "end": 285.528,
          "en": "When they're run open from this image, it will take time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 285.528,
          "end": 287.34000000000003,
          "en": "But what about containers?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 287.34000000000003,
          "end": 288.33,
          "en": "They're very fast to run,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 288.33,
          "end": 289.86,
          "en": "because they're not running the entire OS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 289.86,
          "end": 291.08299999999997,
          "en": "you're just running a container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
